        <p class="adt-body italic leading-relaxed text-left">
          <span data-id="pg062_n0020">Pavar&#xeb;sia e Kosov&#xeb;s u shpall m&#xeb; 17 shkurt 2008.</span>
          <span data-id="pg062_n0021">Kjo dat&#xeb; sh&#xeb;non fest&#xeb;n m&#xeb; t&#xeb; r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme t&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s dhe festohet me shum&#xeb; dashuri.</span>
          <span data-id="pg062_n0022">N&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; vendin ton&#xeb; dhe n&#xeb; t&#xeb; gjitha vendet ku jetojn&#xeb; shqiptar&#xeb;t, organizohen aktivitete festive p&#xeb;r ta sh&#xeb;nuar k&#xeb;t&#xeb; dit&#xeb;.</span>
          <span data-id="pg062_n0023">Shteti yn&#xeb; krijoi simbolet shtet&#xeb;rore: flamurin, stem&#xeb;n dhe himnin shtet&#xeb;ror.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-8 adt-body leading-relaxed text-left">
          <span data-id="pg062_n0025">Flamuri i Kosov&#xeb;s ka ngjyr&#xeb;n e kalt&#xeb;r, mbi t&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; v&#xeb;n&#xeb; nj&#xeb; hart&#xeb; e verdh&#xeb; e Kosov&#xeb;s dhe ka gjasht&#xeb; yje t&#xeb; bardha sip&#xeb;r saj.</span>
          <span data-id="pg062_n0026">Yjet n&#xeb;nkuptojn&#xeb; gjasht&#xeb; popujt &#x2013; komunitetet etnike q&#xeb; jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-7 adt-body leading-relaxed text-left">
          <span data-id="pg062_n0028">Stema e Kosov&#xeb;s &#xeb;sht&#xeb; simbol i Republik&#xeb;s s&#xeb; Kosov&#xeb;s.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-7 adt-body leading-relaxed text-left">
          <span data-id="pg062_n0030">Himni &#xeb;sht&#xeb; nj&#xeb; k&#xeb;ng&#xeb; solemne, e cila ekzekutohet n&#xeb; ceremonit&#xeb; shtet&#xeb;rore, n&#xeb; &#xe7;do veprimtari nd&#xeb;rkomb&#xeb;tare, n&#xeb; ngjarjet sportive ku vendi yn&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;marr&#xeb;s, si dhe n&#xeb; raste t&#xeb; tjera t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rcaktuara me ligje p&#xeb;rkat&#xeb;se.</span>
